/forntend/tests/

/backend/backups/finance-cleanup/

# Mobile app: build outputs and release files (never commit)
*.apk
**/release-apk/
*.aab
*.apks
*.idsig
**/android/app/release/
**/android/app/build/
**/android/build/
**/android/app/.cxx/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/.kotlin/
